              <div class="step-num">2</div>
              <div class="step-body">
                <strong>Build a small test corpus</strong>
                <p>Pick 5–10 clinical PDFs that represent your actual use case. Parse them with Docling. Inspect the Markdown output. That is your ground truth for downstream retrieval quality.</p>
