              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <div class="step-num">4</div>
              <div class="step-body">
                <strong>Build your local stack if you handle PHI</strong>
                <p>Docling + Chroma + Ollama is a complete, zero-egress RAG stack. Deploy it on Railway or a local server and you have a HIPAA-compatible clinical AI foundation.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

